chapter.v:
	The foolish 

	 person will no longer be called generous,Nor the miser said to be bountiful;
 [Jer. 15:8; Hos.]

	On the 

	 land of my people will come up thorns and briers,Yes, on all the happy homes in the joyous city;
 [Is. 1:29; 57:5, 7; Jer. 2:20; Ezek.] [Amos 7:17; [Rom. 1:28-32]]
